1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,620
Mornings come slower than they used to

2
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:07,780
My hand shakes a little on the coffee cup

3
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:11,220
Got a body that's quieter than my spirit

4
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:14,980
And a heart that never learned to give up

5
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:18,900
There was a season I could barely lift a spoon

6
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:22,740
Counting ceiling tiles in a hospital room

7
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:24,580
I can't drive the miles to your kitchen

8
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:26,660
Can't knock when your night's gone long

9
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:28,500
So I sit at the table with a pencil

10
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:30,740
And I fold every prayer into a song

11
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:34,420
Some are made of courage, some are made of rain

12
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:37,860
Some I wrote while learning how to hold a pen again

13
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:39,940
So I'm lighting paper lanterns

14
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:41,700
Sending them into the night

15
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:43,300
Every word I couldn't carry

16
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:45,380
I'm giving wings and a little light

17
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:47,220
If one ever finds your window

18
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:49,780
When the clouds are hanging low

19
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:52,500
Take it, it was always yours

20
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,580
Light one, let it go

21
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:58,340
Light one, let it go
